OL,3,GNEWSATeacher sexually abused pupils at
OL,4,Amultiple schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fsexually abusing a 16-year-old boy
OL,8,Fafter previously admitting offences
OL,9,Fagainst two teenage girls.
OL,11,FFormer PE teacher Bronwen James, 30, of
OL,12,FChippenham, Wiltshire, previously
OL,13,Fadmitted nine sexual offences against
OL,14,Ftwo teenage girls - one a pupil at
OL,15,FBitterne Park School in Southampton and
OL,16,Fthe other at Hardenhuish School in
OL,17,FChippenham.
OL,19,FShe was convicted earlier at Winchester
OL,20,FCrown Court of three counts of sexual
OL,21,Factivity with a 16-year-old boy who
OL,22,Falso attended Bitterne Park School.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
